WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
My kids wanted to play with Lego

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.380
and got me to fix it up for them

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.820
And so after building for them I
found it was great fun

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.380
And I started collecting Lego

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.600
I'm Evan Chang, and I'm
doing interior design

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.000
I'm actually 38 this year

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.200
I collect
a few collections like Lego

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:33.260
Dragonball, One Piece, Bearbricks,
Bruce Lee and a lot of 1/6 figures

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:39.500
So the money spent on all my toys is around six figures

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:45.170
I started off Lego at a later
stage, which was these two/three years

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:49.920
I really respect all the Lego designers,
the way they design the houses,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.629
The details and everything is so nice. For myself my occupation is

00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:57.880
doing interior design and I 
really like them

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:03.500
It took me half a year to buy everything
back, and and I actually started so late

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.700
that you know some of the sets I bought it at a
very high price

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.980
And one of it is, the Green Grocer which I actually bought at $3,000

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.780
Slowly when I started to build them

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:20.480
There's the fun in it,
seeing the interior, the design of every detail.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:25.760
Then I actually went to put
in LED lights to light up the city.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:32.340
Out of my collection
my most prized is Batman series

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:37.049
When I started collecting all
the minifigures series, I liked Batman

00:01:37.049 --> 00:01:40.180
so I my friend told me there's a Bible.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.450
so you know I got this book they told me that

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.420
this is the book that has all the
Batmans listed inside.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.880
So what i did is I went to Carousell after buying the book

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.740
to check every single
one of it and I put a post-it

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:59.850
to tell myself which one I don't have
which one I have, you know from there I

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:05.880
keep buying just a complete the whole
book of it you know within a month

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:09.320
one of the Batmans that I like is the Batman with the bat

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.120
which is the the most expensive prized piece that I have

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:18.120
Its a SDCC exclusive and it 
cost me $460 just to get this

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:24.820
Right now I'm actually more focused on collecting monotones

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.980
The monochrome colours and 
collecting all the different colours.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:33.660
I actually used of my minifig series to match the colors you

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:38.660
know to wash off the prints just to get
the colors of the minifigs

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:45.380
So sometimes one minifig it may go up $100 to get all the parts together.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:50.920
Sometimes you need to buy four
figures just to complete one.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:02.920
For stormtroopers when I liked it, the set is already EOL End Of Life

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.020
They no longer produce it so
you have to buy it secondhand

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.600
So this is actually the box that I'm looking for

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:14.240
The first time getting them was quite funny

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.820
I actually went to Carousell to see someone selling at

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:22.100
$25 per box. So I thought, okay great I will get
from him

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.310
and he actually mentioned that

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:27.640
how many boxes do you want? And I said, 
Fine just let me know how many you have.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.660
I want everything, but I didn't realize that he actually

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:32.080
have 36 box of it.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.680
He told me you have to
transfer the money so I just transferred

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:39.860
the $900 to him and you know within an
hour he actually sent it

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:44.180
So that's how I first got 36 boxes of the stormtroopers.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:50.340
Slowly because of the amount boxes that
I have, I kept increasing it

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:58.760
After stormtroopers I wanted to buy
Star Wars, to start collecting this new series.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:03.540
I felt that the R2D2 was very nice
and they told me that R2 is actually

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.360
under the Ultimate Collector Series

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.420
So in that case what more UCS sets are there

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.860
so I focused on buying the UCS

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.130
But I haven't complete it's

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:19.830
because most of the old series is very
expensive in the market and I feel that

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:25.100
you know since the new ones coming out I
might as well wait for the new ones

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.420
Okay, the funny thing is that

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:30.080
I've never watched Star Wars, the movies or anything.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.140
which means I don't know 
anything about Star Wars at all

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:44.420
The most effort put in for all my
toys is the Lego that is in my coffee table

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.420
Initially when I planned this, I
actually asked my carpenter in.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.440
So we actually designed the coffee table for it

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.000
Then I started to build a train set in it

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.300
because I want to have a train at a
coffee table

00:04:54.560 --> 00:05:00.780
I don't know how to use those those Lego
programs to build my diorama,

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.860
So it was a hands-on process

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:12.000
building and re-doing it until what it is now.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.940
I actually spent three weeks to build it,

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.820
But it is not just me alone,
my wife actually got involved

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:22.200
All the trees that stand inside the diorama
were built by my wife

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.520
Both of us will spend time together building
this coffee table

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.780
and it was not an easy process.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:33.120
Lego is really fun and it keeps
our family bonded

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:37.300
My wife and I will play Lego together
and even my kids

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:41.620
Our family of four will play together

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:49.800
I had all my figures before I moved in to this flat and designing it

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.880
So I knew what I wanted and how to house it.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.700
I love to play with toys and I

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:00.120
like to display them I don't like them
to be in the boxes

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:07.000
I prefer them to be out in
the light and also it's a sign of respect to the toys

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.560
Out of my whole house
the favourite part

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.980
is actually the doors.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.300
It actually it took me and my

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:20.500
carpenter which we actually sit down to
design it you know to make sure that I

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:24.640
can house all my minifig series every
single row must be at least able to house

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:29.980
from 16 to 20 of it. And I mean I have to
lock it just to be safe in case

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:33.420
my kids took out to play with them

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.360
Since starting my collection, I have gotten to know more friends

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.877
and we have become very good
friends

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.060
we have a group Whatsapp

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.700
talking about Legos

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.240
One of my groups which we actually call

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:52.260
The Last Order Council, till today I
thought I have a lot of toys but

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:57.060
actually my toy collection is the least
among them all

